				<wikidot:authorName>Joreth</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1370009</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is abysmal, and lacks the element of surprise that makes the very similar <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-026-j">SCP-026-J</a> funny</p> <p>The fact that there's a need for you to say YEAH DO YOU GET IT NOW IT'S A <strong>PUN</strong> AND MOST IMPORTANTLY <strong><em>PUNS ARE FUNNY</em></strong> WHY AREN'T YOU LAUGHING YET LAUGH IS FUN points to the fact that this really is just a long buildup to a predictable and unsatisfactory ending</p> <p>This is really, really unfunny and it's a firm -1 from me</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
